      "maxReviews": 2,
      "interactiveArgs": [
        "--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox",
        "{msg}"
      ],
      "note": "Builds and interactive windows run with --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox (owner decision 2026-11-08): the default sandbox asked the owner to approve tool use again and again. Reviews stay read-only. Interactive windows use plain codex (default login): the codexr wrapper crashed the TUI (remote app-server worker channel closed) and each account slot asks to trust the folder again. Headless runs use codexr (rotation).",
